# Raw packet captures — too large, often contain identifying traffic
captures/*.pcap
captures/*.pcapng
captures/*.cap
*.pcap
*.pcapng

# Diagnostic summaries are ephemeral and contain your IPs/MACs/hostnames.
# Regenerate them on demand with the scripts.
summaries/*.txt
summaries/*.json

# Local override of the network map (your real device inventory).
# Keep the template (docs/network_map.example.md) checked in instead.
docs/network_map.md

# Your local CLAUDE.md may end up with personal context after a few sessions.
# The committed CLAUDE.md is a sanitized template — opt in to ignoring local edits:
# CLAUDE.local.md

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
